                                    <span id="ctl00_ContentPlaceHolder1_lblTitle2"><font face="Tahoma" color="Black" size="2">A resolution appropriating a total of $3,500,000 from the Metropolitan Government of Nashville and Davidson County, acting by and through the Office of Homeless Services, to Depaul USA, Inc. for the provision of property management, on-site support, and case management services at Strobel House Permanent Supportive Housing.</font></span>
                                </td>
			</tr>
		</table>
		
